    <string name="about_github_link_copied">No browser found. GitHub link copied to clipboard.</string>
    <string name="about_github_browser_unavailable">No browser found to open GitHub.</string>
    <string name="about_lineage">JL-Mod Plus is an independent fork of JL-Mod by woesss (Yury Kharchenko). JL-Mod is based on J2ME Loader by Nikita Shakarun, which traces back to NaikSoftware’s J2meLoader.</string>
    <string name="about_evolution">JL-Mod Plus builds on that foundation with a modern interface, a more capable MIDlet library, new features, and support for newer Android versions.</string>
